        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>云南各地美食</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  body {\n    background: #0d5b52;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #0d5b52;\n    padding: 10px 0 6px 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .title {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n    margin: 8px 0 2px 0;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"STKaiti\", \"KaiTi\", serif;\n  }\n  .title-rule {\n    width: 340px;\n    height: 0;\n    border-top: 3px solid #d94a3d;\n    margin: 0 auto 14px auto;\n  }\n  .card {\n    background: #cdf3e4;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    margin: 0 10px 10px 10px;\n    padding: 8px 12px 10px 12px;\n  }\n  .city {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    display: inline-block;\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #d94a3d;\n    padding-bottom: 1px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .item {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    margin: 3px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .name {\n    color: #d94a3d;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #7fbfae;\n    color: #cdf3e4;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .ph-left {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    bottom: 6px;\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 90px;\n    line-height: 90px;\n  }\n  .ph-right {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    bottom: 6px;\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 110px;\n    line-height: 110px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title\">云南各地美食</div>\n  <div class=\"title-rule\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"city\">昆明</div>\n    <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">小锅米线：</span>昆明，米线种类众多，当首推小锅米线，还有一种砂锅米线</div>\n    <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">汽锅鸡：</span>这个汤不是直接加的水，也就是说这个锅里原来只有鸡肉和作料，一点水不加。那汤是哪来的呢？水蒸气</div>\n    <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">过桥米线：</span>不能算昆明小吃，应该在蒙自。连最有名的桥香园总店也是在蒙自</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"city\">大理</div>\n    <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">饵丝：</span>比煎饼果子好吃！其实没什么可比性。可以加些菜，香肠鸡蛋什么的。酱可以选择咸的或者甜的</div>\n    <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">凉鸡米线：</span>将做好的白斩鸡撕成条，拌入米线里，加入梅子醋和调料，最后浇上一勺卤子水，入口酸甜爽滑</div>\n    <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">乳扇：</span>能煎能炸、能烩能炒，还能卷成筒状内塞馅料。本地常吃的方法是用菜油煎黄后，撒盐或白糖食用</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"city\">丽江</div>\n    <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">鸡豌豆凉粉：</span>豆经碾磨成粉浆，灰绿色，煎炸凉拌都很入味</div>\n    <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">酥油茶：</span>分甜咸两种口味，可以试试</div>\n    <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">鸡豆凉粉：</span>口感爽滑细腻，既可以凉吃也可以热吃，凉粉上加入红辣椒、花椒、青葱酸醋等作料，很是美味</div>\n    <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">丽江粑粑：</span>加入火腿、油、糖等材料制作成的盘子大小“千层饼”似的圆饼</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"city\">香格里拉</div>\n    <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">糌粑：</span>是青稞麦炒熟、磨细、不过筛的炒面</div>\n    <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">迪庆坨坨肉：</span>迪庆彝族的主要煮肉形式。将猪肉或羊、牛肉，不放佐料用冷水煮熟</div>\n    <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">奶渣：</span>奶渣从牛奶中提制而成。用酥油煎奶渣加红糖而成的煎奶是藏家人待客常用的一道菜</div>\n    <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"name\">中甸酸奶：</span>用提炼过酥油的奶制作的，适合老人和小孩食用</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder ph-left\">[装饰花草图案：左下角]</div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder ph-right\">[装饰花草图案：右下角]</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
